==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - headers:
      Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'
      X-Frame-Options: DENY
==== explainer ====
HTTP response headers to include when serving this hypermedia
